{
  "flow_id": "post_service_feedback",
  "version": 3,
  "status": "draft",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "start",
      "type": "startNode",
      "data": {
        "label": "Start"
      },
      "position": {
        "x": 0.0,
        "y": 0.0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "crm_lookup",
      "type": "apiNode",
      "data": {
        "label": "http://mock/crm/{{from}}"
      },
      "position": {
        "x": 200.0,
        "y": 0.0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "intro",
      "type": "messageNode",
      "data": {
        "label": "Hello {{salutation}}, I'm Supriya from Alcon. Am I speaking with {{name}}?"
      },
      "position": {
        "x": 400.0,
        "y": 0.0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "check_id",
      "type": "conditionNode",
      "data": {
        "label": "identity_verified == true"
      },
      "position": {
        "x": 600.0,
        "y": 0.0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ask_satisfaction",
      "type": "messageNode",
      "data": {
        "label": "Thank you {{salutation}}. Were all requested jobs done to your complete satisfaction?"
      },
      "position": {
        "x": 798.0,
        "y": 0.0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "check_satisfaction",
      "type": "conditionNode",
      "data": {
        "label": "satisfaction_check == true"
      },
      "position": {
        "x": 1000.0,
        "y": 0.0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "escalation",
      "type": "messageNode",
      "data": {
        "label": "I'm sorry to hear that {{salutation}}. I am escalating this to our senior service team immediately. They will contact you to resolve this. May I still ask for your ratings for other areas?"
      },
      "position": {
        "x": 1000.0,
        "y": 200.0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "check_esc_continue",
      "type": "conditionNode",
      "data": {
        "label": "continue == true"
      },
      "position": {
        "x": 1200.0,
        "y": 200.0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ask_advisor",
      "type": "messageNode",
      "data": {
        "label": "That's great to hear. Now, on a scale of one to ten, how would you rate the service advisor\u2019s explanation of work and charges?"
      },
      "position": {
        "x": 1200.0,
        "y": -0.8408964152537095
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "check_advisor",
      "type": "conditionNode",
      "data": {
        "label": "advisor_rating >= 9"
      },
      "position": {
        "x": 1400.0,
        "y": 0.0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "advisor_reason",
      "type": "messageNode",
      "data": {
        "label": "I've noted the rating of {{advisor_rating}}. May I know the reason for this rating, so we can improve our service?"
      },
      "position": {
        "x": 1400.0,
        "y": 100.0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ask_pickup",
      "type": "messageNode",
      "data": {
        "label": "Thank you for sharing that. Next, how would you rate the pickup process after servicing?"
      },
      "position": {
        "x": 1600.0,
        "y": 0.0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ask_pickup_direct",
      "type": "messageNode",
      "data": {
        "label": "Thank you. Next, how would you rate the pickup process after servicing?"
      },
      "position": {
        "x": 1600.0,
        "y": -100.0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "check_pickup",
      "type": "conditionNode",
      "data": {
        "label": "pickup_rating >= 9"
      },
      "position": {
        "x": 1800.0,
        "y": 0.0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "pickup_reason",
      "type": "messageNode",
      "data": {
        "label": "Understood. Could you share the reason for the {{pickup_rating}} rating for the pickup process?"
      },
      "position": {
        "x": 1800.0,
        "y": 100.0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ask_cleanliness",
      "type": "messageNode",
      "data": {
        "label": "Noted. And how would you rate the cleanliness and condition of the car?"
      },
      "position": {
        "x": 2000.0,
        "y": 0.0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ask_cleanliness_after_reason",
      "type": "messageNode",
      "data": {
        "label": "Got it. And how would you rate the cleanliness and condition of the car?"
      },
      "position": {
        "x": 2000.0,
        "y": 100.0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "check_cleanliness",
      "type": "conditionNode",
      "data": {
        "label": "cleanliness_rating >= 9"
      },
      "position": {
        "x": 2200.0,
        "y": 0.0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cleanliness_reason",
      "type": "messageNode",
      "data": {
        "label": "Thank you. Could you please tell me why you gave a {{cleanliness_rating}} for cleanliness?"
      },
      "position": {
        "x": 2200.0,
        "y": 100.0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ask_overall",
      "type": "messageNode",
      "data": {
        "label": "Finally, how would you rate your overall workshop experience?"
      },
      "position": {
        "x": 2400.0,
        "y": 0.0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "check_overall",
      "type": "conditionNode",
      "data": {
        "label": "overall_rating >= 9"
      },
      "position": {
        "x": 2600.0,
        "y": 0.0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "overall_reason",
      "type": "messageNode",
      "data": {
        "label": "I've noted your rating of {{overall_rating}}. Any suggestions on how we can make your overall experience better?"
      },
      "position": {
        "x": 2600.0,
        "y": 100.0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "closing",
      "type": "messageNode",
      "data": {
        "label": "Thank you for your valuable feedback! We've noted your suggestions and will work on them. Have a great day!"
      },
      "position": {
        "x": 2800.0,
        "y": 0.0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "end",
      "type": "endNode",
      "data": {
        "label": "End"
      },
      "position": {
        "x": 3000.0,
        "y": 0.0
      }
    }
  ],
